  "title": {
    "zh": "泄压阀极差报告",
    "en": "Pressure Range Report"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "三支探头、边界读数、跨区回收",
    "en": "Three probes, extreme readings and a cross-bay recovery"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收回三支探头并到出口。readings 字典列出读数。地址 0 要保留最低值，地址 1 要保留最高值，地址 2 要保留两者之差。提交一个从内存读出的极差。 限 25 回合，避开巡逻。scan() 列出巡线、目标坐标和 compass 方向表。第二张地图将图纸旋转半圈。",
    "en": "Recover all three probes and reach the exit. Their readings are in the readings dictionary. Leave the minimum in cell 0, the maximum in cell 1 and the difference in cell 2. Submit the range using a memory read. Avoid patrols within 25 turns. scan() lists patrol cycles, goal locations and the compass for plan directions. The second map rotates the plan by 180 degrees."
  },
